RESET       reset
START       start
TEXT        Foe METAGROSS's CLEAR BODY\nprevented SALAMENCE's INTIMIDATE from working!
TEXT        SALAMENCE used DRAGON DANCE!
MOVE        anim Dragon Dance
STAT_CHANGE 2 stats +1
TEXT        SALAMENCE's ATTACK\nrose!
TEXT        SALAMENCE's SPEED\nrose!
TEXT        Foe METAGROSS used METEOR MASH!
MOVE        anim Meteor Mash
HIT         hit
HP          hp 60/100
STAT_CHANGE atk +1
TEXT        Foe METAGROSS's ATTACK\nrose!
TEXT        <trainer>\nwithdrew METAGROSS!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        <trainer> sent\nout SUICUNE!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 1
TEXT        SALAMENCE used SWORDS DANCE!
MOVE        anim Swords Dance
STAT_CHANGE atk +2
TEXT        SALAMENCE's ATTACK\nsharply rose!
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE used CALM MIND!
MOVE        anim Calm Mind
STAT_CHANGE 2 stats +1
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE's SP. ATK\nrose!
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE's SP. DEF\nrose!
TEXT        SALAMENCE used DRAGON DANCE!
MOVE        anim Dragon Dance
STAT_CHANGE spe +1
TEXT        SALAMENCE's SPEED\nrose!
TEXT        SALAMENCE used SWORDS DANCE!
TEXT        SALAMENCE's ATTACK\nwon't go higher!
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE used CALM MIND!
MOVE        anim Calm Mind
STAT_CHANGE 2 stats +1
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE's SP. ATK\nrose!
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE's SP. DEF\nrose!
TEXT        SALAMENCE, that's enough!\nCome back!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        Go! SNORLAX!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 1
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE used TICKLE!
MOVE        anim Tickle
STAT_CHANGE 2 stats -1
TEXT        SNORLAX's ATTACK\nfell!
TEXT        SNORLAX's DEFENSE\nfell!
TEXT        SNORLAX used CURSE!
MOVE        anim Curse
TEXT        SNORLAX's SPEED\nfell!
TEXT        SNORLAX's ATTACK\nrose!
TEXT        SNORLAX's DEFENSE\nrose!
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE used RECOVER!
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE's\nHP is full!
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE used CALM MIND!
TEXT        Foe SUICUNE's stats won't\ngo any higher!
TEXT        SNORLAX used SUBSTITUTE!
MOVE        anim Substitute
HP          hp 75/100
TEXT        SNORLAX made\na SUBSTITUTE!
TEXT        <trainer>\nwithdrew SUICUNE!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        <trainer> sent\nout JOLTEON!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 2
TEXT        SNORLAX used BODY SLAM!
MOVE        anim Body Slam
HIT         hit
HP          hp 70/100
STATUS      status par
TEXT        Foe JOLTEON is paralyzed! It may be unable to move!
TEXT        SNORLAX, OK!\nCome back!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        Go! SWAMPERT!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 2
TEXT        Foe JOLTEON used THUNDER WAVE!
TEXT        It doesn't affect SWAMPERT…
TEXT        SWAMPERT used BODY SLAM!
TEXT        Foe JOLTEON is\nalready paralyzed!
TEXT        SWAMPERT, that's enough!\nCome back!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        Go! ZAPDOS!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 3
TEXT        Foe JOLTEON used THUNDERBOLT!
MOVE        anim Thunderbolt
HIT         hit
HP          hp 40/100
TEXT        It's super effective!
TEXT        ZAPDOS used THUNDERBOLT!
HP          hp 95/100
TEXT        Foe JOLTEON restored HP\nusing its VOLT ABSORB!
TEXT        ZAPDOS used THUNDERBOLT!
TEXT        Foe JOLTEON's VOLT ABSORB\nmade THUNDERBOLT useless!
TEXT        <trainer>\nwithdrew JOLTEON!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        <trainer> sent\nout GENGAR!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 3
TEXT        ZAPDOS, that's enough!\nCome back!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        Go! SWAMPERT!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 2
TEXT        Foe GENGAR used DESTINY BOND!
MOVE        anim Destiny Bond
TEXT        Foe GENGAR is trying\nto take its foe with it!
TEXT        SWAMPERT used EARTHQUAKE!
TEXT        Foe GENGAR makes GROUND\nmoves miss with LEVITATE!
TEXT        Foe GENGAR used WISH!
MOVE        anim Wish
TEXT        SWAMPERT used ROCK SLIDE!
MOVE        anim Rock Slide
HIT         hit
HP          hp 0/100
FAINT       faint
TEXT        Foe GENGAR fainted!
TEXT        Foe GENGAR took\nSWAMPERT with it!
HP          hp 0
FAINT       faint
TEXT        SWAMPERT fainted!
TEXT        <trainer> sent\nout NINJASK!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 4
TEXT        Go! SNORLAX!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 1
TEXT        Foe NINJASK used DOUBLE KICK!
MOVE        anim Double Kick
HIT         hit
HP          hp 70/100
MOVE        anim (next hit)
HIT         hit
HP          hp 65/100
TEXT        Hit 2 time(s)!
ANIM        item anim
STAT_CHANGE spe +1
TEXT        Using SALAC BERRY, the SPEED\nof Foe NINJASK rose!
STAT_CHANGE spe +1
TEXT        Foe NINJASK's SPEED BOOST\nraised its SPEED!
TEXT        <trainer>\nwithdrew NINJASK!
SWITCH_OUT  switch out
TEXT        <trainer> sent\nout HOUNDOOM!
SWITCH_IN   switch in slot 5
TEXT        SNORLAX used REST!
MOVE        anim Rest
ANIM        wish anim
TEXT        Gengar's WISH\ncame true!
HP          hp 100/100
TEXT        SNORLAX regained\nhealth!
TEXT        Foe HOUNDOOM's FLASH FIRE\nraised its FIRE power!
TEXT        Player defeated\n<trainer>!
END         end
